{"id":71279,"date":"2026-10-29T07:29:36","date_gmt":"2026-10-29T07:29:36","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71279"},"modified":"2026-10-29T08:32:53","modified_gmt":"2026-10-29T07:32:53","slug":"caminhada-e-corrida-da-universidade-de-coimbra","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/caminhada-e-corrida-da-universidade-de-coimbra\/","title":{"rendered":"Caminhada e Corrida da Universidade de Coimbra 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Caminhada e Corrida da Universidade de Coimbra 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Caminhada e Corrida da Universidade de Coimbra 2027<\/strong> (2\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>28 de fevereiro de 2027<\/strong> (Domingo) em <strong>Coimbra<\/strong>, celebrando o anivers\u00e1rio da mais antiga institui\u00e7\u00e3o universit\u00e1ria portuguesa num evento que une desporto, esp\u00edrito acad\u00e9mico, bem-estar e solidariedade. Com partida instalada na hist\u00f3rica <strong>Rua Larga<\/strong> (Polo I, na Alta Universit\u00e1ria classificada como Patrim\u00f3nio Mundial da UNESCO) e meta no <strong>Est\u00e1dio Universit\u00e1rio de Coimbra<\/strong>, na margem esquerda do rio Mondego, a prova convida estudantes, docentes, antigos alunos, atletas e toda a comunidade a viver o campus em movimento.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Para esta segunda edi\u00e7\u00e3o, podes escolher entre tr\u00eas desafios com forte simbolismo hist\u00f3rico: a nova <strong>Corrida Ano de Funda\u00e7\u00e3o (12,90 km)<\/strong>, cuja quilometragem homenageia o ano de 1290 em que D. Dinis fundou o Estudo Geral; a <strong>Corrida de Anivers\u00e1rio (7,37 km)<\/strong>, que celebra os 737 anos da institui\u00e7\u00e3o; e a <strong>Caminhada UC (4 km)<\/strong>, pensada para desfrutar do percurso entre a Alta de Coimbra, a travessia do Mondego e a zona ribeirinha de Santa Clara. Ap\u00f3s cortares a meta no Est\u00e1dio Universit\u00e1rio, a festa prossegue na <strong>Vila Healthy Campus UC<\/strong>, um espa\u00e7o de conv\u00edvio dedicado \u00e0 sa\u00fade, nutri\u00e7\u00e3o e sustentabilidade.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada diretamente pela <strong>Universidade de Coimbra (Healthy Campus UC)<\/strong>, esta edi\u00e7\u00e3o refor\u00e7a o seu compromisso social e inclusivo: <strong>50% do valor das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es reverte a favor da ACAPO<\/strong> (Associa\u00e7\u00e3o dos Cegos e Ambl\u00edopes de Portugal), transformando cada quil\u00f3metro percorrido num contributo direto para uma causa solid\u00e1ria.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">28 de Fevereiro de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Rua Larga (Partida) \/ Est\u00e1dio Universit\u00e1rio de Coimbra (Chegada), Coimbra<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.